        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[dim0, dim1, dim2]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.reshape(x, (x.size(0), -1, kernel_size[0] * kernel_size[1]))，其中 kernel_size 为 (3,5)。",
        "仅改变元数据，不改变数据存储，要求输入 contiguous 且总元素数等于 dim0*dim1*dim2。",
        "本任务中 dim0=N, dim1=L, dim2=C*kH*kW，即从 (N, C*kH*kW, L) 重塑为 (N, L, C*kH*kW)。"
      ]
    }
  ],
